{
  "about": "Recorded lines of the Mujard board-app protocol (docs/lang/MUJARD_APP_PROTOCOL.md) and how every reader must understand them. The web, Android and runtime test suites all read this file; a change here is a change to the protocol. 'message': null means the line is not an app message (plain output) or must be ignored.",
